<div class="foe-cat">
  {{#if error}}
  <p class="cat-error">{{error}}</p>
  {{else}}
  <nav class="cat-tabs">
    {{#each tabs}}<button type="button" class="{{#if active}}active{{/if}}" data-action="setTab" data-tab="{{id}}"><i class="{{icon}}"></i> {{label}} <small>{{count}}</small></button>{{/each}}
  </nav>
  <div class="cat-tools">
    <select name="kind" title="{{t "col|Type"}}">
      <option value="">{{t "All types"}}</option>
      {{#each kinds}}<option value="{{v}}" {{#if sel}}selected{{/if}}>{{label}} ({{n}})</option>{{/each}}
    </select>
    <input type="search" name="search" value="{{search}}" placeholder="{{t "Search by name…"}}" autocomplete="off">
    <span class="cat-count"></span>
    {{#if actor}}<span class="cat-caps"><i class="fa-solid fa-coins"></i> {{t "Caps:"}} <b>{{caps}}</b></span>{{/if}}
  </div>
  <div class="cat-scroll">
    <table class="foe-table cat-table">
      <thead><tr><th></th><th class="l">{{t "col|Name"}}</th>{{#each head}}<th>{{this}}</th>{{/each}}<th></th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
      {{#each rows}}
        <tr data-i="{{i}}" data-kind="{{kind}}" data-name="{{search}}">
          <td><img class="icon" src="{{img}}" alt=""></td>
          <td class="l nm" {{#if notes}}title="{{notes}}"{{/if}}>{{name}}{{#if notes}} <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i>{{/if}}</td>
          {{#each cols}}<td>{{this}}</td>{{/each}}
          <td class="buy">
            {{#if qty}}<input type="number" name="qty" value="{{qty}}" min="1" title="{{t "Quantity"}}">{{/if}}
            {{#if ../lockAdd}}{{#if noBuy}}<small class="cat-gm" title="{{t "Only the GM adds for free (world setting)"}}">{{t "via the GM"}}</small>{{/if}}{{else}}<button type="button" data-action="add" title="{{t "Add for free"}}"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i> {{t "Add"}}</button>{{/if}}
            {{#if ../actor}}{{#unless noBuy}}<button type="button" data-action="buy" title="{{t "Buy — price × quantity will be deducted from the caps"}}"><i class="fa-solid fa-coins"></i> {{t "Buy"}}</button>{{/unless}}{{/if}}
          </td>
        </tr>
      {{/each}}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  {{#if isBestiary}}
  <p class="hint">{{t "“Add” creates an NPC actor in the “FoE Bestiary” folder (actors tab) and opens its sheet — then drag it onto the scene. Statistics, hit areas with DT and called-shot MFD, weapons, abilities and loot are from the rulebook (p. 490–576); “description only” — the v1.22 rulebook gives no statistics."}}</p>
  {{else if isAmmo}}
  <p class="hint">{{#if ammoOff}}<b class="warn">{{t "The optional “Special ammo” rule is off (world settings) — you can buy the ammo, but it doesn't work."}}</b> {{/if}}{{t "Special ammo from the rulebook (p. 202–203): “Buy”/“Add” asks for the caliber, the price is the regular ammo price × the multiplier. You load the type when reloading the weapon; changing the type ejects the remaining rounds into the inventory. With the rule on, regular rounds and energy ammo ignore 5 DT."}}</p>
  {{else if isCyber}}
  <p class="hint">{{t "“Add” installs an implant or a cyberlimb in the character (asks for the leg or attribute and warns about contraindications: Zebra Augmented, Bone Strengthening Brew, alicorns). Effects from the rulebook (the Cyberpony trait and table IX of implants, p. 104–107) are counted automatically; the descriptive effect is in the note. The rulebook gives no prices — a doctor or an Auto-Doc installs them, the GM decides the cost."}}</p>
  {{else if isVehicles}}
  <p class="hint">{{t "“Add” creates a vehicle in the “FoE Vehicles” folder (actors tab) together with its mounted weapons from the catalog. Then drag it onto the scene and add the crew (drag characters onto the vehicle sheet). Size and damage per wound are from the rulebook's table XLI; DT, speeds and crew are suggestions you can change on the sheet (the v1.22 rulebook has no vehicle statistics)."}}</p>
  {{else}}
  <p class="hint">
    {{#if actor}}{{t "“Add” gives the item for free, “Buy” deducts the price (× quantity) from the character's caps. The same gear stacks."}}{{else}}{{t "“Add” creates the item in the Items tab — then drag it onto a character."}}{{/if}}
    {{t "Hover over"}} <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i> {{t "to read the rulebook notes. Weapons arrive loaded, armor — taken off (put it on in the Inventory tab)."}}
  </p>
  {{/if}}
  {{/if}}
</div>
